| Command | What it does |
| --- | --- |
| `npm run dev` | Builds the workspace, runs every service and Vite on http://localhost:{{ ports.WEB_PORT }}; rebuilds/restarts services on Rust, migration, `services.json` or `.env` changes. `-- --only notes,edge`, `-- --no-web` |
| `npm run build` | Type-checks, builds `web/dist` and release binaries of every service |
| `npm start` | Runs the release builds; the edge serves the app and the API on http://localhost:{{ ports.EDGE_PORT }} |
| `npm test` | Vitest + `cargo test --workspace` |
| `npm run check` | The quality gate: ESLint + clippy, Prettier + rustfmt, vue-tsc, all tests |
| `npm run lint` / `npm run format` | Lint only / format everything (Prettier + `cargo fmt`) |
| `cargo test -p app-<name>` | Tests of one crate or service |
| `npm run setup` | Creates `.env` from `.env.example` with a fresh `MASTER_KEY` (`-- --port-base 9000` shifts every port) |
